Both the springs are in parallel so net spring constant is $K_{\text {net }}=K_{1}+K_{2}=40 \mathrm{~N} / \mathrm{m}$



So $T=2 \pi \sqrt{\frac{m}{K_{n e t}}}$



$$
\begin{aligned}
& =2 \pi \sqrt{\frac{2}{40}} \\\\
& =\frac{\pi}{\sqrt{5}}
\end{aligned}
$$



$\therefore x=5$
